2. Executive Principles & Operational Constraints
Business Impact & Scalability First: Architecture prioritizes cost predictability (edge serverless, token optimization via cached skill schemas) and high developer velocity without enterprise risk.
Zero-Trust Security Baseline: No client-side service tokens; strict Row-Level Security on 100% of database tables; strict Content Security Policy; rate limiting on all public endpoints.
Immutable Auditing: Every administrative change, login event, role modification, export, and autonomous agent action writes synchronously to an append-only audit_logs table.
Strict Type Safety & Layer Decoupling: Strict TypeScript (noImplicitAny, zero any), runtime Zod schema validation at all network and IPC boundaries, and clear separation between UI, state, domain logic, and Supabase client layers.
